{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.508, "data": {"request_id": "c61e74865248", "seq": 22, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:12.683Z", "t_ms": 7353, "delta": "* **Risk of overestimating agent capabilities:** Autonomous agents often implement simple logic with low information density and struggle to grasp tasks"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.571, "data": {"request_id": "c61e74865248", "seq": 23, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:12.843Z", "t_ms": 7513, "delta": " without clear, detailed requirements (e.g., producing basic representations for a Snake game or static placeholders instead of external databases)"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.637, "data": {"request_id": "c61e74865248", "seq": 24, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:12.907Z", "t_ms": 7577, "delta": " [C2]. Consequently, the technology is currently better suited for prototype systems rather than complex real-world applications [C2"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.71, "data": {"request_id": "c61e74865248", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:12.977Z", "t_ms": 7647, "delta": "].\n* **Complexity of automated evaluation:** Evaluating general-purpose software is inherently complex compared to traditional function-level code"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.858, "data": {"request_id": "c61e74865248", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:13.128Z", "t_ms": 7799, "delta": " generation [C2]. Manual verification on large datasets is impractical, and while their study focuses on completeness, executability, consistency"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.048, "data": {"request_id": "c61e74865248", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:13.300Z", "t_ms": 7971, "delta": ", and overall quality, future work must account for other dimensions such as functionalities, robustness, safety, and user-friendliness"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.292, "data": {"request_id": "c61e74865248", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:13.521Z", "t_ms": 8191, "delta": " [C2].\n* **High computational and environmental costs:** Compared to single-agent systems, multi-agent frameworks require"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.41, "data": {"request_id": "c61e74865248", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:12:13.628Z", "t_ms": 8299, "delta": " more tokens and time, resulting in higher computational demands and environmental impact [C2]."}}
